<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0658_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Bugsy</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0658_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Huh? I can’t hear you. The\nconnection trash.\rCall back from somewhere else!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0658_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wassup? How you doin’?\nI’m doin’ great as usual!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0658_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">There’s SO many stronger Block\nBosses than me out there.\rYou tryna hit every Block\naround the region, ain’t you?\fThat’s great! Keep it up!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0658_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Thursdays around noon, I’m\nusually free.\fIf you wanna see my Bug-type homies\fagain, call me then!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0658_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh, you called at just the right time!\nI ain’t doin’ nothin’ right now.\fWanna scrap again? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0658_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Aight!\rSee you at\nthe Saffron Dojo!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0658_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I see...\nWell, ain’t no helpin’ that...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0658_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Huh?\nIt’s great you wanna scrap,\fbut ain’t you got other plans?\rHandle those plans\nfirst, then gimme a call.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0658_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Aight, I’ll be waitin’ for you at\nthe Saffron Dojo!\fRace you there!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0658_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Yeah, this Bugsy...\nWhat’s good?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0658_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, didn’t we make plans to meet at\nthe Saffron Dojo for a\fscrap? You forget or somethin’?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0658_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know, everybody deadass into\nBug types when they kids.\rBut then for some reason, as people\ngrow up, at some point they start\fto like Bug types less and less.\rWhat about you?\nYou still like Bug-type homies?\rEven if I grow up I’ll NEVER stop\nlikin’ Bug types, no way!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0658_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My Block got such a different trick\nto it, don’t it?\rMight seem like it was real hard\nto set up a trick like that...\fBut truth is, it was actually\fpretty easy.\rFirst we ran the ropes through the\nBlock, then the homies helped us\ffinish everythin’ else!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0658_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I think I told you this already,\nbut you know I’m doin’\fresearch on Bug-type homies?\rThere’s SO many kinds, it’s\nkinda hard, you know?\rI’m ONLY studyin’ Bug types,\nand it’s still this hard.\rPeople like Professor Elm and\nProfessor Oak who study every\fkinda homie is deadass\fsomethin’ else, you know?</language>
	</row>
</body>
